<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN COLLATED RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN COLLATED RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated results of the 10th day of the US$7.6 million Australian Open tennis tournment on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles, quarter-finals:</p>
<p>Carlos Moya (Spain) beat 14-Felix Mantilla (Spain) 7-5 6-2 6-7</p>
<p>(5-7) 6-2</p>
<p>2-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat 9-Marcelo Rios (Chile) 7-5 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Women's singles, quarter-finals:</p>
<p>12-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat Kimberly Po (U.S.) 6-4</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Mary Pierce (France) beat 16-Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) 1-6 6-4</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Men's doubles, quarter-finals:</p>
<p>1-Todd Woodbridge/Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat Martin Damm</p>
<p>(Czech Republic)/Andrei Olhovskiy (Russia) 6-3 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>11-Rick Leach/Jonathan Stark (U.S.) beat 4-Ellis Ferreira</p>
<p>(South Africa)/Patrick Galbraith (U.S.) 7-5 2-6 6-4 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Women's doubles, quarter-finals:</p>
<p>4-Martina Hingis (Switzerland)/Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat</p>
<p>Virginia Ruano-Pascual (Spain)/Paola Suarez (Argentina) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>3-Lindsay Davenport/Lisa Raymond (U.S.) beat 12-Conchita</p>
<p>Martinez (Spain)/Patricia Tarabini (Argentina) 6-4 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>2-Larisa Neiland (Latvia)/Helena Sukova (Czech Republic) beat</p>
<p>13-Naoko Kijimuta/Nana Miyagi (Japan) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>1-Gigi Fernandez (U.S.)/Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) beat</p>
<p>5-Nicole Arendt (U.S.)/Manon Bollegraf (Netherlands) 6-4 7-5.</p>
</text>
